# textdomain: doggiowars
# Italian translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=Combattimento aereo sopra isole voxel fluttuanti — SEI TU il caccia. 12 biomi insulari, vulcani e cascate, acrobazie aeree, terreno distruttibile e corse di levrieri dietro a un coniglio d'oro. Tastiera + gamepad.
